        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. For employees on either system, earned sick leave for each month or quadri-weekly cycle is credited on the first day of the following month or quadri-weekly cycle, except that proportionate sick leave credit for an eligible employee who is separating from employment shall be credited at the completion of the last day on pay status. The number of sick leave hours which may be accumulated is unlimited.",
            "block_bbox": [
                181,
                346,
