            "block_content": "1) The employee's spouse, parent(s) or children, suffer an illness or disability as defined in Article 14 - Leaves of Absence, Section D.3.d.1 Use of sick leave granted under this provision shall be charged against the Family Care Leave entitlement pursuant to Article 14 - Leaves of Absence, Section D.3.d.1, or",
